Positive account patterns combine before exclusions in CLI and API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight aggregate --accounts 'Jakob:*' --accounts '~Jakob:Tillgångar*' --accounts '~*foobar*' --accounts '~*baz'

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['Jakob:*', '~Jakob:Tillgångar*', '~*foobar*', '~*baz'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Jakob:Cash
account Jakob:Tillgångar:Cash
account Jakob:foobar
account Jakob:baz
account Other:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Opening
  Jakob:Cash  1 SEK
  Jakob:Tillgångar:Cash  2 SEK
  Jakob:foobar  3 SEK
  Jakob:baz  4 SEK
  Other:Cash  5 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

1.00 SEK  Jakob:Cash

========== API-OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Jakob:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "1"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========
